      "preview": "גְּלַל: substantivo masculino: causa, razão.",
      "html": "† I. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">גְּלַל</span>]</big>  <strong>substantivo.</strong>[<strong>masculino.</strong>] <strong>causa</strong>, somente em estado construto com <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּגְלַל</span> <em>por causa de, por amor de</em> <strong>(</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">جَلَلٌ</span> <em>um assunto grande e importante;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">مِنْ جَلَلِكَ</span> por tua <em>causa;</em> cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן בִּגְלַל דְּ</span> <em>porque</em> no 𝔗 palestinense, como <a data-ref=\"Psalms 4:9\" href=\"/Psalms.4.9\">Sl 4.9</a>, e <span dir=\"rtl\">ܓܠܰܠ</span> no siríaco de Jerusalém PS<sup>731</sup><strong>)</strong> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:5\" href=\"/Genesis.39.5\">Gn 39.5</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> abençoou a casa do egípcio <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּגְלַל יוֹסֵף</span> <em>por causa de</em> José, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.10\">Dt 15.10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 18:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.18.12\">Dt 18.12</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:16\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.16\">1Rs 14.16</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 11:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.11.17\">Jr 11.17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.4\">Jr 15.4</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּגְלָלֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:27\" href=\"/Genesis.30.27\">Gn 30.27</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּגְלָלֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 12:13\" href=\"/Genesis.12.13\">Gn 12.13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּגְלַלְכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:37\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.37\">Dt 1.37</a> <a data-ref=\"Micah 3:12\" href=\"/Micah.3.12\">Mq 3.12</a>.",
