      "preview": "גַּל²: substantivo masculino: monte, onda, vaga; também fonte.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גַּל</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:48\" href=\"/Genesis.31.48\">Gn 31:48</a></sup> <strong>monte, onda, vaga (</strong>como <em>amontoado por rolamento, rolando, enrolando-se</em><strong>)</strong>, também <strong>fonte</strong>, texto massorético <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:12\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.12\">Ct 4.12</a> cf. <strong>3</strong> abaixo.—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּל</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 8:17\" href=\"/Job.8.17\">Jó 8.17</a> + 5 vezes (inclusive <span dir=\"rtl\">הַגַּל</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:48\" href=\"/Genesis.31.48\">Gn 31.48</a> +); <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּ֑ל</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:46\" href=\"/Genesis.31.46\">Gn 31.46</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הַגָּ֑ל</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:46\" href=\"/Genesis.31.46\">Gn 31.46</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לַגָּ֑ל</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.2\">Is 25.2</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּל־</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:26\" href=\"/Joshua.7.26\">Js 7.26</a> + 2 vezes + <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:47\" href=\"/Genesis.31.47\">Gn 31.47</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:48\" href=\"/Genesis.31.48\">Gn 31.48</a> veja-se abaixo; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּלִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:25\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.25\">2Rs 19.25</a> + 6 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּלֵּי־</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 48:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.48.18\">Is 48.18</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּלָּיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:10\" href=\"/Psalms.89.10\">Sl 89.10</a> + 6 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּלֵּיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 65:8\" href=\"/Psalms.65.8\">Sl 65.8</a> + 2 vezes;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>monte</em> de pedras, <strong>a.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳ אבנים</span> erguido <span dir=\"rtl\">(הקים)</span> sobre um cadáver <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:26\" href=\"/Joshua.7.26\">Js 7.26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:29\" href=\"/Joshua.8.29\">Js 8.29</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 18:17\" href=\"/II_Samuel.18.17\">2Sm 18.17</a> (com <span dir=\"rtl\">הִצִּיב</span>). <strong>b.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּל</span> isoladamente <a data-ref=\"Job 8:17\" href=\"/Job.8.17\">Jó 8.17</a> (raízes entrelaçadas em torno dele). <strong>c.</strong>  <em>monte</em> ou <em>pilha</em> feito <span dir=\"rtl\">(עשׂה)</span> para uso na ratificação do pacto de Jacó com Labão <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:46\" href=\"/Genesis.31.46\">Gn 31.46</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:48\" href=\"/Genesis.31.48\">Gn 31.48</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:51\" href=\"/Genesis.31.51\">Gn 31.51</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:52\" href=\"/Genesis.31.52\">Gn 31.52</a><sup>(×3)</sup> cf. também <a data-ref=\"BDB, גַּלְעֵד\" href=\"/BDB,_גַּלְעֵד\" dir=\"rtl\">גַּלְעֵד</a> <strong>nome próprio.</strong> <strong>d.</strong>  <em>monte</em> de ruínas <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.2\">Is 25.2</a>; alhures no plural <a data-ref=\"Hosea 12:12\" href=\"/Hosea.12.12\">Os 12.12</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:25\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.25\">2Rs 19.25</a> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:26\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.26\">Is 37.26</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 15:28\" href=\"/Job.15.28\">Jó 15.28</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 9:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.9.10\">Jr 9.10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:37\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.37\">Jr 51.37</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>ondas</em> (<em>vagas</em>) poético, somente no plural, ondas do mar <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.22\">Jr 5.22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:35\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.35\">Jr 31.35</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.15\">Is 51.15</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 38:11\" href=\"/Job.38.11\">Jó 38.11</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 65:8\" href=\"/Psalms.65.8\">Sl 65.8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:10\" href=\"/Psalms.89.10\">Sl 89.10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:25\" href=\"/Psalms.107.25\">Sl 107.25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:29\" href=\"/Psalms.107.29\">Sl 107.29</a>; cf. também em comparação <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.3\">Ez 26.3</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 48:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.48.18\">Is 48.18</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(גַּלֵּי־הַיָּם)</span>; figuradamente, dos castigos provenientes de <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 42:8\" href=\"/Psalms.42.8\">Sl 42.8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁבָּרִים</span>) <a data-ref=\"Jonah 2:3\" href=\"/Jonah.2.3\">Jn 2.3</a> (‖ <em>idem</em>); do exército do conquistador de Babilônia <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:42\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.42\">Jr 51.42</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:55\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.55\">Jr 51.55</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 10:11\" href=\"/Zechariah.10.11\">Zc 10.11</a> (VB; mas Bev<sup>JPh. xviii. 88</sup> propõe <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּבְלִים</span> cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.9\">Ez 27.9</a>).<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>fonte</em>, <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:12\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.12\">Ct 4.12</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּן נָעוּל אֲחוֹתִי כַּלָּ֑ה גַּל נָעוּל מַעְיָן חָתוּם</span> <em>um jardim fechado</em> (<em>é</em>) <em>minha irmã, noiva, uma fonte fechada, um manancial selado;</em> mas <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּן</span> em lugar de <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּל</span> 𝔊 𝔖 𝔙.",
