      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גְּלִילָה</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino. circunscrição, limite, território</strong> —<span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.8\">Ez 47.8</a>; alhures plural construto <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּלִילוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:2\" href=\"/Joshua.13.2\">Js 13.2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:10\" href=\"/Joshua.22.10\">Js 22.10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:11\" href=\"/Joshua.22.11\">Js 22.11</a> <a data-ref=\"Joel 4:4\" href=\"/Joel.4.4\">Jl 4.4</a>;—pertencente a um povo <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּל־גְּלִילוֹת הַפְּלִשְׁתִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:2\" href=\"/Joshua.13.2\">Js 13.2</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Joel 4:4\" href=\"/Joel.4.4\">Jl 4.4</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(כֹּל ג׳ פְּלָ֑שֶׁת)</span>; assim <span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳ הַיַּרְדֵּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:10\" href=\"/Joshua.22.10\">Js 22.10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:11\" href=\"/Joshua.22.11\">Js 22.11</a> segundo alguns, mas veja-se o seguinte; absoluto <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.8\">Ez 47.8</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">הַגּ׳ הַקַּדְמוֹנָה</span>; como <strong>nome próprio de lugar.</strong> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 15:29\" href=\"/II_Kings.15.29\">2Rs 15.29</a> <em>Galileia</em>, 𝔊 Γαλιλαια (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כֹּל אֶרֶץ נַפְתָּלִי</span>) cf. II. <a data-ref=\"BDB, גָּלִיל²\" href=\"/BDB,_גָּלִיל²\" dir=\"rtl\">גָּלִיל</a>.",
