      "ref": "BDB, גִּלּוּל",
      "preview": "גִּלּוּל: substantivo masculino: ídolos; somente no plural.",
      "html": "† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">גִּלּוּל</span>]</big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup><span data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:27\" data-bdbh-source-href=\"/Jeremiah.50.27\" data-bdbh-source-label=\"Je 50:27\" data-bdbh-suspended=\"BIBLICAL_REFERENCE_DIVERGENCE\">Jr 50.27</span></sup> somente plural, ídolos <strong>(</strong>= <em>toras, blocos</em>, coisas informes Ges Baud<sup>Rel. i. 95</sup>; Ew <em>imagens de bonecos</em> &gt; <em>coisas semelhantes a esterco</em> Sm <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 6:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.6.4\">Ez 6.4</a> SS segundo os rabinos.<strong>)</strong> Veja-se Baud<sup>ZMG, 1904, 395 ff.</sup> (compara o aramaico bíblico <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּלָל (אֶבֶן)</span>, palmireno <span dir=\"rtl\">גללא</span><sup>Tariff i. 9</sup> = στήλη λιθίνη; e conclui que era originalmente uma designação do menir de pedra primitivo ou <span dir=\"rtl\">מַצֵּבָה</span>) <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּלּוּלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.3\">Ez 22.3</a> + 3 vezes + <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 30:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.30.13\">Ez 30.13</a> (suprima-se B Co); <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּלֻּלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 15:12\" href=\"/I_Kings.15.12\">1Rs 15.12</a> + 2 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּלּוּלֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.10\">Ez 8.10</a> + 6 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּלּוּלַיִךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.4\">Ez 22.4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּלּוּלָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 21:11\" href=\"/II_Kings.21.11\">2Rs 21.11</a> + 4 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּלּוּלֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.2\">Jr 50.2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ֵיכֶם</span><a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:30\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.30\">Lv 26.30</a> + 7 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">ֵיכֶן</span><a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:49\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.49\">Ez 23.49</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ֵיהֶם</span><a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 6:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.6.9\">Ez 6.9</a> + 14 vezes + <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 6:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.6.5\">Ez 6.5</a> (suprima-se, aramaico bíblico, outros e Co [leitura digital: del Biblical Aramaic al Co]); <span dir=\"rtl\">ֵיהֶן</span><a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:37\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.37\">Ez 23.37</a>;—<em>ídolos</em> (39 vezes em Ez);—<a data-ref=\"I Kings 15:12\" href=\"/I_Kings.15.12\">1Rs 15.12</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 17:12\" href=\"/II_Kings.17.12\">2Rs 17.12</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 21:21\" href=\"/II_Kings.21.21\">2Rs 21.21</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 6:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.6.5\">Ez 6.5</a> (suprima-se Co) veja-se <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 6:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.6.9\">Ez 6.9</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 6:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.6.13\">Ez 6.13</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 14:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.14.4\">Ez 14.4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 14:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.14.5\">Ez 14.5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 18:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.18.6\">Ez 18.6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 18:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.18.15\">Ez 18.15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.16\">Ez 20.16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.24\">Ez 20.24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:39\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.39\">Ez 20.39</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:37\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.37\">Ez 23.37</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:39\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.39\">Ez 23.39</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:49\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.49\">Ez 23.49</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 33:25\" href=\"/Ezekiel.33.25\">Ez 33.25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 44:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.44.10\">Ez 44.10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 44:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.44.12\">Ez 44.12</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁקּוּצִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 29:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.29.16\">Dt 29.16</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:24\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.24\">2Rs 23.24</a> (‖ também <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּרָפִים</span>), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.7\">Ez 20.7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.18\">Ez 20.18</a> (ambos com o verbo <span dir=\"rtl\">טמא</span>) veja-se <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.8\">Ez 20.8</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 37:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.37.23\">Ez 37.23</a>, cf. também <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.10\">Ez 8.10</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁקֶץ</span>, mas <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁקּוּצִים</span> aparentemente 𝔊 𝔖 𝔗 e assim Co); ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹעֵבָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 14:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.14.6\">Ez 14.6</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 21:11\" href=\"/II_Kings.21.11\">2Rs 21.11</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 18:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.18.12\">Ez 18.12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:36\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.36\">Ez 16.36</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(גִּלּוּלֵי תוֹעֲבוֹתַיִךְ)</span>, e <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:26\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.26\">1Rs 21.26</a> (onde o verbo <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּעַב</span>); ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">טֻמְאוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:25\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.25\">Ez 36.25</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִכְשׁוֹל עֲוֹנוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 14:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.14.3\">Ez 14.3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 14:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.14.4\">Ez 14.4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 14:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.14.7\">Ez 14.7</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲצַבִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.2\">Jr 50.2</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלִילִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 30:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.30.13\">Ez 30.13</a> (Co <span dir=\"rtl\">אילים</span>; cf. também acima); ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חַמָּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 6:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.6.4\">Ez 6.4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 6:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.6.6\">Ez 6.6</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:30\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.30\">Lv 26.30</a> (cf. abaixo); ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּרָפִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:24\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.24\">2Rs 23.24</a> (acima); na expressão <span dir=\"rtl\">טִמֵּא בְּגִלּ׳</span> etc. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.7\">Ez 20.7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.18\">Ez 20.18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:31\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.31\">Ez 20.31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.3\">Ez 22.3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.4\">Ez 22.4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.7\">Ez 23.7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:30\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.30\">Ez 23.30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.18\">Ez 36.18</a> (suprima-se Co); <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּחַלְּלוּ בְגִלּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:39\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.39\">Ez 20.39</a>;—note-se especialmente a expressão <span dir=\"rtl\">וְנָתַתִּי פִּגְרֵיכֶם עַל־פִּגְרֵי גִלּוּלֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:30\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.30\">Lv 26.30</a> <em>e porei os vossos cadáveres sobre os cadáveres dos vossos ídolos</em>.",
