      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גֻּלְגֹּ֫לֶת</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino. crânio, cabeça, indivíduo</strong> (pessoa) <strong>(</strong>Ba<sup>NB 205</sup>; aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוּלְגַּלְתָּא</span>, árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">جُمْجُمَة</span> <strong>)</strong>—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:35\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.35\">2Rs 9.35</a> + 3 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">גֻּלְגָּלְתּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:53\" href=\"/Judges.9.53\">Jz 9.53</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 10:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.10.10\">1Cr 10.10</a>; plural com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">גֻּלְגְּלֹתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:2\" href=\"/Numbers.1.2\">Nm 1.2</a> + 5 vezes;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>crânio</em>, quebrado por uma pedra <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:53\" href=\"/Judges.9.53\">Jz 9.53</a>; separado do corpo <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:35\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.35\">2Rs 9.35</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 10:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.10.10\">1Cr 10.10</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>cabeça, indivíduo</em> (em contagem, tributação etc.; somente P e tardio) <span dir=\"rtl\">עֹמֶר לַגּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:16\" href=\"/Exodus.16.16\">Êx 16.16</a> <em>um ômer para cada homem;</em> cf. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:26\" href=\"/Exodus.38.26\">Êx 38.26</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:2\" href=\"/Numbers.1.2\">Nm 1.2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:18\" href=\"/Numbers.1.18\">Nm 1.18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:20\" href=\"/Numbers.1.20\">Nm 1.20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:22\" href=\"/Numbers.1.22\">Nm 1.22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:47\" href=\"/Numbers.3.47\">Nm 3.47</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.3\">1Cr 23.3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.24\">1Cr 23.24</a>.",
