      "preview": "גִּלְעָדִי: adjetivo gentílico: gileadita.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גִּלְעָדִי</span></big>  <strong>adjetivo gentílico.</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  de <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּלְעָד</span> <strong>6 a.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:29\" href=\"/Numbers.26.29\">Nm 26.29</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  de <strong>5.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Judges 11:1\" href=\"/Judges.11.1\">Jz 11.1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 11:40\" href=\"/Judges.11.40\">Jz 11.40</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 12:7\" href=\"/Judges.12.7\">Jz 12.7</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  de <span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳</span> <strong>nome próprio de lugar.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Judges 10:3\" href=\"/Judges.10.3\">Jz 10.3</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:27\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.27\">2Sm 17.27</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:32\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.32\">2Sm 19.32</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 2:7\" href=\"/I_Kings.2.7\">1Rs 2.7</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:61\" href=\"/Ezra.2.61\">Ed 2.61</a> = <span data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:62\" data-bdbh-source-href=\"/Nehemiah.7.62\" data-bdbh-source-label=\"Ne 7:63\" data-bdbh-suspended=\"BIBLICAL_REFERENCE_DIVERGENCE\">Ne 7.63</span>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי גִלְעָדִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 15:25\" href=\"/II_Kings.15.25\">2Rs 15.25</a>;—cf. também sob <a data-ref=\"BDB, גִּלְעָד\" href=\"/BDB,_גִּלְעָד\" dir=\"rtl\">גִּלְעָד</a> <strong>5</strong>.",
