      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גְּמוּל</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino. trato, retribuição, benefício</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 94:2\" href=\"/Psalms.94.2\">Sl 94.2</a> + 11 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּמֻלְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:15\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.15\">Ob 1.15</a>, etc.; plural com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּמוּלָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 103:2\" href=\"/Psalms.103.2\">Sl 103.2</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּמוּל יָדַיִם</span> <em>ação das mãos</em> <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:16\" href=\"/Judges.9.16\">Jz 9.16</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.14\">Pv 12.14</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(יָשׁוּב לְ)</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.11\">Is 3.11</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(יֵעָשֶׂה לְ)</span>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>trato</em>, donde (pelo contexto) <em>equivalente da ação, retribuição:</em> com sufixo <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:15\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.15\">Ob 1.15</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">גמלך ישׁוב בראשׁך</span>, <a data-ref=\"Joel 4:4\" href=\"/Joel.4.4\">Jl 4.4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joel 4:7\" href=\"/Joel.4.7\">Jl 4.7</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(הֵשִׁיב)</span>, assim com <span dir=\"rtl\">הֵשִׁיב לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 28:4\" href=\"/Psalms.28.4\">Sl 28.4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁלֵּם לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 137:8\" href=\"/Psalms.137.8\">Sl 137.8</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.17\">Pv 19.17</a>; absolutamente <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁלֵּם (הֵשִׁיב) גְּמוּל לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.18\">Is 59.18</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.6\">Is 66.6</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.6\">Jr 51.6</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:64\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.64\">Lm 3.64</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Joel 4:4\" href=\"/Joel.4.4\">Jl 4.4</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 94:2\" href=\"/Psalms.94.2\">Sl 94.2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 35:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.35.4\">Is 35.4</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳ אלהים</span> <em>a retribuição de Deus</em>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>benefício:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">אַל תשׁכחי כל גמוליו</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 103:2\" href=\"/Psalms.103.2\">Sl 103.2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כגמול עליו</span> <em>segundo o benefício</em> (feito) <em>a ele</em> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 32:25\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.32.25\">2Cr 32.25</a>",
